                <head>[Inclosure 2.]</head>
                <p>[This inclosure is identical with the first item of the foregoing correspondence
                    entitled “Establishment of a tribunal or mixed commission,” etc., namely, the
                    note of November 5, 1910, from the Nicaraguan minister for foreign affairs to
                    the American minister, Mr. Dawson.]</p>
